<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 23pt;text-indent:36pt;">For 2025, we reported Consolidated EBITDA of $8,699,000, which was below the threshold, resulting in a 0.0% payout for the consolidated financial performance component of the 2025 STIP for Messrs. Blashford,&#160;Ciccone&#160;and Mayo.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 23pt;text-indent:36pt;">For 2025, we reported EBITDA for the Industrial Solutions segment of $3,266,000, which was above the target but below the maximum amount resulting in a 115.3% payout for the financial performance component of the 2025 STIP for Mr. Mayo.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

