<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>2025&#160;Summary Compensation </b></p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 23pt;text-indent:36pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 23pt;text-indent:36pt;">The following table provides information regarding the compensation earned during the last two fiscal years by the following executive officers, whom we collectively refer to as our &#8220;named executive officers&#8221; or &#8220;NEOs&#8221; for purposes of this Proxy Statement.</p>

