			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Total includes&#160;a $10,000 one-time cash retention bonus paid to Mr. Ciccone on July 3, 2025 and the $12,141 2025&#160;annual incentive payment that will be paid to Mr. Ciccone in April 2026.</p>
