			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;">Includes outstanding restricted stock awards pursuant to the A&amp;R EIP&#160;Plan which has been&#160;approved by our stockholders.</p>
			</td>
